    "before"

     head
      |
      v
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+
    | "c" |---->| "b" |---->| "a" |----> null
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+


    "after push(d): the new node becomes the head"

     head
      |
      v
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+     +-----+
    | "d" |---->| "c" |---->| "b" |---->| "a" |----> null
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+     +-----+


    "after pop(): head moves on, and d is handed back"

                 head
                  |
                  v
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+     +-----+
    | "d" |     | "c" |---->| "b" |---->| "a" |----> null
    +-----+     +-----+     +-----+     +-----+
